# Patient Appointment No-Show Reduction System

## Project Overview

**Project Type:** Healthcare Business Analysis Project
**Domain:** Healthcare / Hospital Operations
**Role:** Business Analyst
**Methodology:** Agile
**Duration:** 3 Months
**Tools:** Jira, Figma, Excel, SQL, Power BI, Draw.io

## Background

Hospitals manage a large number of outpatient appointments every day. However, some patients do not attend their scheduled appointments without cancelling or rescheduling in advance.

Patient no-shows can result in unused appointment slots, reduced doctor utilization, operational inefficiencies, and potential revenue loss.

This project focuses on analyzing the appointment process and designing a solution to reduce patient no-shows through automated reminders, appointment confirmation, easy rescheduling, cancellation tracking, and management reporting.

## Problem Statement

The hospital currently experiences patient appointment no-shows. Patients may forget appointments, face scheduling conflicts, experience transportation problems, or fail to receive timely reminders.

The existing process provides limited proactive communication and does not provide an efficient way for patients to confirm, cancel, or reschedule appointments.

## Project Objective

The primary objective of this project is to design a business solution that can help the hospital reduce appointment no-shows and improve appointment utilization.

The proposed solution will:

* Provide automated appointment reminders.
* Allow patients to confirm appointments.
* Allow patients to reschedule appointments.
* Capture cancellation reasons.
* Track appointment statuses.
* Provide management with appointment performance reports.
* Identify patterns in patient no-shows.

## Expected Business Outcome

The proposed solution aims to improve patient attendance, reduce unused appointment slots, improve staff efficiency, and provide management with better visibility into appointment performance.

## Success Metrics

The project will measure:

* Appointment no-show rate
* Appointment confirmation rate
* Cancellation rate
* Rescheduling rate
* Doctor/slot utilization
* Reminder delivery rate
* Monthly no-show trend

